unbound (1.2.0-0ubuntu1) jaunty; urgency=low

  * New upstream release
    - Update debian/copyright
    - Change usr/lib/libunbound.so.0.14.0 to usr/lib/libunbound.so.0.17.0 in
      debian/libunbound0.install
    - Update debian/libunbound0.symbols
    - Add (>=1.4.0) version to ldns-dev build-dep due to upstream requirement
  * Default install in chroot (supported by Ubuntu sysklogd)
    - Change debian/unbound.default to CHROOT=yes
    - Add debian/syslogd to provide sysklogd/syslogd the path to get log
      information from the chroot and add to unbound.install

 -- Scott Kitterman <scott@kitterman.com>  Fri, 23 Jan 2009 12:57:26 -0500

